hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18216","Musa ibn Dawud narrated to us, Layth ibn Sad narrated to us from Yazid from Sahl ibn Muadh from his father, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Ride these animals sound and leave them sound, and do not take them as chairs."
